- add new commit "ASoC: fsl_asrc: Change asrc_width to asrc_format"
- modify binding doc to yaml format
- remove fsl_easrc_dma.c, make fsl_asrc_dma.c useable for easrc.

changes in v2
- change i.MX815 to i.MX8MN
